- [Marker Kinds](#Marker Kinds) — `linked-pair` is the 6th kind.
- [Marker Fields](#Marker Fields) — `link-open`, `link-close`, `link-attribute`, `body-attribute`, `auto-external`, `attr-<name>-from`, `link-hash-prefix`, `link-tooltip-attribute`, `link-angle-brackets` are all documented there with the IMAGE and LINK worked examples.
